{"strongs": "H5048", "word": "נֶ֫גֶד", "translit": "ne.ged", "root": "נגב", "morph": "H:A", "pos": "substantive", "gloss": "what is conspicuous or in front", "definition": "נֶ֫גֶד 151 substantive what is conspicuous or in front , always as adverb or preposition in front of, in sight of, opposite to , נֶ֑גֶד , construct נֶגֶד , suffix נֶגְדִּי Ps 38:11 +, נֶגְדְּךָ Ps 38:10 +, etc.; with ה locative נֶ֫גְדָּה Ps 116:14 ; Ps 116:18 — 1. as adverb accusative in front of , \\ \\ a. locally (rather stronger and distincter than לִפְנֵי ), \\ \\ \\ ( a ) Gen 31:32 נֶגֶד אַחֵינוּ הַכֶּרנָֿא in front of our brethren own it, now, v Gen 31:37 ; Gen 47:15 ולמה נמות נגדך why should we die in thy sight ? Exod 19:2 Israel encamped נגד ההר in front of the mountain, Exod 34:10 נגד כלעֿמך אעשׂה נִפְלָאֹת , before, in sight of, all thy people (compare Ps 78:12 ), Josh 3:16 the people passed over נגד ירחו in front of J., 1Kgs 20:27 , etc.; Neh 3:23 in front of their house, v Neh 3:29 נגד (כלׅ ישׂראל Deut 31:11 ; Josh 8:35 = 1Sam 15:30 ; 2Sam 12:12 +; 1Kgs 21:13 set Naboth נֶגֶד הָעָם ; ׳ נגד י 1Sam 12:3 ; 1Sam 16:6 מְשִׁיחוֺ ׳ אַךְ נֶגֶד י , so נֶגְדִּי Ps 89:37 , נֶגְדּוֺ Ps 18:13 נגד השׁמשׁ Num 25:4 ; 2Sam 12:12 ; Ps 22:26 יראיו ׳ נ , Ps 52:11 (so in poetry נֶגְדָּה לְ Ps 116:14 ; Ps 116:18 ); hostilely, Job 10:17 with collateral idea of to the mortification of , Ps 23:5 ; Ps 31:20 , compare Joel 1:16 with collateral idea of being open or known to , Prov 15:11 ׳ שׁאול ואבדון נגד י , Job 26:6 ; Ps 38:10 נגדך כלתֿאותי || (ממך לא נסתרהׅ , Ps 69:20 (|| יָדַעְתָּ ), Ps 119:168 ; Isa 59:12 so נֶגֶד פָּנַי הָיוּ Hos 7:2 . \\ \\ \\ ( b ) with reflexive suffix, and verb of motion, to go in front of oneself , i.e. straightforward , Josh 6:5 ועלו העם אישׁ נגדו each straightforward , v Josh 6:20 ; Amos 4:3 ; Jer 31:29 ; Neh 12:37 , compare Prov 4:25 . \\ \\ b. mentally, = vividly present to, Ps 38:18 ומכאובי נגדי תמיד , Ps 44:16 ; Ps 51:5 וחטאתי נגדי תמיד , Ps 109:15 ׳ י ׳ נ (remembered by): nearly = בְּעֵינָיו , כְּאַיִן נֶגְדּוֺ Isa 40:17 ; Ps 39:6 so ׳ וְנ פְּנֵיהֶם נְבוֺנִים Isa 5:21 . But Exod 10:10 כי רעה נגד פניכם before your face is = in your view, or purpose (compare לא אשׁית לְנֶגֶד עֵינַי דברבֿליעל Ps 101:3 ). 2. With prepositions: \\ \\ a. כְּנֶגֶד according to what is in front of = corresponding to , Gen 2:18 I will make him עֵזֶר כְּנֶגְדּוֺ a help corresponding to him i.e. equal and adequate to himself, v Gen 2:20 among the animals there was no עֵזֶר כְּנֶגְדּוֺ . ** Note that in Late Hebrew מכנגד = in front of , Ber 4:5; 9:5; Ab 2:10, מכנגד פני Git 7:7 and elsewhere. \\ \\ b. לְנֶגֶד in front of, before , Gen 33:12 וְֵאלְכָה לְנֶנְדֶּ֑ךָ , Num 22:32 ; 2Kgs 1:13 fell on his knees לנגד אליהו , Isa 1:7 your ground לנגדכם זרים אֹכלים אותהּ ; with עָמַד Josh 5:13 ; Dan 8:15 ; Dan 10:16 , in a hostile sense v Dan 10:13 , compare Prov 21:30 in the sight or presence of , Hab 1:3 וְשֹׁד וְחָמָס לְנֶגְדִּי , Ps 39:2 בעוד רשׁע לנגדי , Ps 50:8 ועולֹתיך לנגדי תמיד , Neh 3:37 opposite to (probably of opposite choirs), Neh 12:9 ; Neh 12:24 = parallel to , 1Chr 5:11 = over, for , a business (peculiar) Neh 11:22 figurative of what is visible morally, Ps 18:23 כי כל משׁפטיו לנגדי (|| לֹא אָסִיר מֶנִּי ), with to set or place Ps 16:8 ; Ps 54:5 לא שׂמו אלהים לנגדם (compare Ps 86:14 ,), Ps 90:8 often in the phrase לְנֶגֶד עֵינֵי ֗֗֗ , both literal, as Job 4:16 תְּמוּנָה עֵינָ֑י ׳ לנ , Ps 5:6 עיניך ׳ לא יתיצבו הוללים לנ (compare Ps 101:7 ); and in a moral sense, Ps 18:25 עיניו ׳ כְּבֹר ידי לנ , Ps 26:3 עיני ׳ כי חסדך לנ i.e. is ever present to my mind, Ps 36:2 עיניו ׳ אין פחד אלהים לנ i.e. he has no eye to discern God's awe-inspiring judgments (compare Ps 10:5 ); with לא אשׁית i.e. have in view, purpose (|| שׂנאתי ) Ps 101:3 . \\ \\ c. מִנֶּגֶד \\ \\ \\ ( a ) adverb off ( מִן 1 c ) the front, in front, opposite, ex adverso , Gen 21:16 ותשׁב להּ מנגד sat her down opposite , v Gen 21:16 , 2Kgs 2:7 ; Deut 28:66 והיו חייך תלואים לך מנגד shall be hung up for thee in front (i.e. suspended, as by a thread, in front of thee); Judg 9:17 וישׁלך נפשׁו מנגד and flung away his life in front or straight away (i.e. hazarded it); = some way off, from or at a distance , Num 2:2 ; Deut 32:52 כי מִנֶּגֶד תראה את הארץ , 2Kgs 2:15 ׳ וַיִּרְאֻהוּ מנ at a distance , 2Kgs 3:22 ; 2Kgs 4:25 aloof , 2Sam 18:13 ואתה תתיצב מנגד , Obad 1:11 \\ \\ \\ ( b ) as a preposition \\ \\ \\ ( a ) from the front of, away from , Song 6:5 הָסֵבִּי עֵינַיִךְ מִנֶּגְדִּי , 1Sam 26:20 אליֿפֹל ׳ פני י ׳ דמי ארצה מנ ; מנגד עיני from before the eyes of , with verbs of removing Isa 1:16 , cutting off Ps 31:23 ; Jonah 2:5 , hiding Amos 9:3 ; Jer 16:17 . ( β ) opposite to , Neh 3:19 ; Neh 3:25 ; Neh 3:27 at a distance from , Ps 10:5 מרום משׁפטיך מנגדו , Ps 38:12 מנגד נגעי יעמדו . ( γ ) מִנֶּגֶד לְ from before , Prov 14:7 , in front of Judg 20:34 . \\ \\ d. עַד נֶגֶד as far as the front of , Neh 3:16 ; Neh 3:26 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4963')\">BDB4963</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5048')\">H5048</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4962')\">BDB4962</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4964')\">BDB4964</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>נֶ֫גֶד</bdbheb><sub>151</sub> <b>substantive</b> <highlightword>what is conspicuous or in front</highlightword>, always as <b>adverb</b> or <b>preposition</b> <highlightword>in front of, in sight of, opposite to</highlightword>, <bdbheb>נֶ֑גֶד</bdbheb>, construct <bdbheb>נֶגֶד</bdbheb>, suffix <bdbheb>נֶגְדִּי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 38:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,38,11)\">Ps 38:11</ref> +, <bdbheb>נֶגְדְּךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 38:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,38,10)\">Ps 38:10</ref> +, etc.; with <bdbheb>ה</bdbheb> <highlight>locative</highlight> <bdbheb>נֶ֫גְדָּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 116:14\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"116\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"116\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(19,116,14)\">Ps 116:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 116:18\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"116\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"116\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(19,116,18)\">Ps 116:18</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> as adverb accusative <highlight>in front of</highlight>, <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> locally (rather stronger and distincter than <bdbheb>לִפְנֵי</bdbheb>), <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;\\&emsp;(<highlight>a</highlight>) <ref ref=\"Gen 31:32\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(1,31,32)\">Gen 31:32</ref> <bdbheb>נֶגֶד אַחֵינוּ הַכֶּרנָֿא</bdbheb> <highlight>in front of</highlight> our brethren own it, now, v<ref ref=\"Gen 31:37\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(1,31,37)\">Gen 31:37</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 47:15\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(1,47,15)\">Gen 47:15</ref> <bdbheb>ולמה נמות</bdbheb> <bdbheb>נגדך</bdbheb> why should we die <highlight>in thy sight ?</highlight> <ref ref=\"Exod 19:2\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(2,19,2)\">Exod 19:2</ref> Israel encamped <bdbheb>נגד ההר</bdbheb> <highlight>in front of</highlight> the mountain, <ref ref=\"Exod 34:10\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(2,34,10)\">Exod 34:10</ref> <bdbheb>נגד כלעֿמך אעשׂה נִפְלָאֹת</bdbheb>, <highlight>before, in sight of, all thy people</highlight> (compare <ref ref=\"Ps 78:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"78\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"78\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,78,12)\">Ps 78:12</ref>), <ref ref=\"Josh 3:16\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(6,3,16)\">Josh 3:16</ref> the people passed over <bdbheb>נגד ירחו</bdbheb> <highlight>in front of</highlight> J., <ref ref=\"1Kgs 20:27\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(11,20,27)\">1Kgs 20:27</ref>, etc.; <ref ref=\"Neh 3:23\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(16,3,23)\">Neh 3:23</ref> <highlight>in front of</highlight> their house, v<ref ref=\"Neh 3:29\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(16,3,29)\">Neh 3:29</ref> <bdbheb>נגד (כלׅ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>ישׂראל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 31:11\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(5,31,11)\">Deut 31:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 8:35\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(6,8,35)\">Josh 8:35</ref> = <ref ref=\"1Sam 15:30\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(9,15,30)\">1Sam 15:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 12:12\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(10,12,12)\">2Sam 12:12</ref> +; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 21:13\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(11,21,13)\">1Kgs 21:13</ref> set Naboth <bdbheb>נֶגֶד הָעָם</bdbheb>; <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נגד י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 12:3\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(9,12,3)\">1Sam 12:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 16:6\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(9,16,6)\">1Sam 16:6</ref> <bdbheb>מְשִׁיחוֺ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אַךְ נֶגֶד י</bdbheb>, so <bdbheb>נֶגְדִּי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 89:37\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,37)\">Ps 89:37</ref>, <bdbheb>נֶגְדּוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 18:13\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(19,18,13)\">Ps 18:13</ref> <bdbheb>נגד</bdbheb> <bdbheb>השׁמשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 25:4\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(4,25,4)\">Num 25:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 12:12\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(10,12,12)\">2Sam 12:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 22:26\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(19,22,26)\">Ps 22:26</ref> <bdbheb>יראיו</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Ps 52:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,52,11)\">Ps 52:11</ref> (so in poetry <bdbheb>נֶגְדָּה לְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 116:14\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"116\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"116\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(19,116,14)\">Ps 116:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 116:18\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"116\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"116\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(19,116,18)\">Ps 116:18</ref>); hostilely, <ref ref=\"Job 10:17\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(18,10,17)\">Job 10:17</ref> with collateral idea of <highlight>to the mortification of</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Ps 23:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,23,5)\">Ps 23:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 31:20\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(19,31,20)\">Ps 31:20</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Joel 1:16\" b=\"29\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(29,1,16)\">Joel 1:16</ref> with collateral idea of being <highlight>open</highlight> or <highlight>known to</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Prov 15:11\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(20,15,11)\">Prov 15:11</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁאול ואבדון נגד י</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Job 26:6\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(18,26,6)\">Job 26:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 38:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,38,10)\">Ps 38:10</ref> <bdbheb>נגדך כלתֿאותי</bdbheb> || <bdbheb>(ממך לא נסתרהׅ</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Ps 69:20\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"69\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"69\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(19,69,20)\">Ps 69:20</ref> (|| <bdbheb>יָדַעְתָּ</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Ps 119:168\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"168\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"168\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,168)\">Ps 119:168</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 59:12\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"59\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"59\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(23,59,12)\">Isa 59:12</ref> so <bdbheb>נֶגֶד פָּנַי הָיוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 7:2\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(28,7,2)\">Hos 7:2</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;\\&emsp;(<highlight>b</highlight>) with reflexive suffix, and verb of motion, to go <highlight>in front of oneself</highlight>, i.e. <highlight>straightforward</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Josh 6:5\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(6,6,5)\">Josh 6:5</ref> <bdbheb>ועלו העם אישׁ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>נגדו</bdbheb> each <highlight>straightforward</highlight>, v<ref ref=\"Josh 6:20\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(6,6,20)\">Josh 6:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Amos 4:3\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(30,4,3)\">Amos 4:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 31:29\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(24,31,29)\">Jer 31:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 12:37\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,37)\">Neh 12:37</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Prov 4:25\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(20,4,25)\">Prov 4:25</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> mentally, = vividly present to, <ref ref=\"Ps 38:18\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(19,38,18)\">Ps 38:18</ref> <bdbheb>ומכאובי נגדי תמיד</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Ps 44:16\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(19,44,16)\">Ps 44:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 51:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,51,5)\">Ps 51:5</ref> <bdbheb>וחטאתי נגדי תמיד</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Ps 109:15\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"109\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"109\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(19,109,15)\">Ps 109:15</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> (remembered by): nearly = <bdbheb>בְּעֵינָיו</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>כְּאַיִן נֶגְדּוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 40:17\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(23,40,17)\">Isa 40:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 39:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,39,6)\">Ps 39:6</ref> so <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וְנ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>פְּנֵיהֶם נְבוֺנִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 5:21\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(23,5,21)\">Isa 5:21</ref>. But <ref ref=\"Exod 10:10\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(2,10,10)\">Exod 10:10</ref> <bdbheb>כי רעה נגד פניכם</bdbheb> <highlight>before your face</highlight> is = in your view, or purpose (compare <bdbheb>לא אשׁית לְנֶגֶד עֵינַי דברבֿליעל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 101:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"101\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"101\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,101,3)\">Ps 101:3</ref>).</p></div><div class=\"section\"><p></div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> With prepositions: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <bdbheb>כְּנֶגֶד</bdbheb> <highlight>according to what is in front of</highlight> = <highlight>corresponding to</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Gen 2:18\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(1,2,18)\">Gen 2:18</ref> I will make him <bdbheb>עֵזֶר כְּנֶגְדּוֺ</bdbheb> a help <highlight>corresponding to</highlight> him i.e. equal and adequate to himself, v<ref ref=\"Gen 2:20\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(1,2,20)\">Gen 2:20</ref> among the animals there was no <bdbheb>עֵזֶר כְּנֶגְדּוֺ</bdbheb>. </div><div class=\"remarks\"><b>**</b>Note that in Late Hebrew <bdbheb>מכנגד</bdbheb> = <highlight>in front of</highlight>, Ber 4:5; 9:5; Ab 2:10, <bdbheb>מכנגד פני</bdbheb> Git 7:7 and elsewhere. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <bdbheb>לְנֶגֶד</bdbheb> <highlight>in front of, before</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Gen 33:12\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(1,33,12)\">Gen 33:12</ref> <bdbheb>וְֵאלְכָה לְנֶנְדֶּ֑ךָ</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Num 22:32\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(4,22,32)\">Num 22:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 1:13\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(12,1,13)\">2Kgs 1:13</ref> fell on his knees <bdbheb>לנגד אליהו</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Isa 1:7\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(23,1,7)\">Isa 1:7</ref> your ground <bdbheb>לנגדכם זרים אֹכלים אותהּ</bdbheb>; with <bdbheb>עָמַד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 5:13\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(6,5,13)\">Josh 5:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 8:15\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(27,8,15)\">Dan 8:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 10:16\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(27,10,16)\">Dan 10:16</ref>, in a hostile sense v<ref ref=\"Dan 10:13\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(27,10,13)\">Dan 10:13</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Prov 21:30\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(20,21,30)\">Prov 21:30</ref> <highlight>in the sight</highlight> or <highlight>presence of</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Hab 1:3\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(35,1,3)\">Hab 1:3</ref> <bdbheb>וְשֹׁד וְחָמָס לְנֶגְדִּי</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Ps 39:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,39,2)\">Ps 39:2</ref> <bdbheb>בעוד רשׁע לנגדי</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Ps 50:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,50,8)\">Ps 50:8</ref> <bdbheb>ועולֹתיך לנגדי תמיד</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Neh 3:37\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(16,3,37)\">Neh 3:37</ref> <highlight>opposite to</highlight> (probably of opposite choirs), <ref ref=\"Neh 12:9\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,9)\">Neh 12:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 12:24\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,24)\">Neh 12:24</ref> = <highlight>parallel to</highlight>, <ref ref=\"1Chr 5:11\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(13,5,11)\">1Chr 5:11</ref> = <highlight>over, for</highlight>, a business (peculiar) <ref ref=\"Neh 11:22\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(16,11,22)\">Neh 11:22</ref> figurative of what is visible morally, <ref ref=\"Ps 18:23\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(19,18,23)\">Ps 18:23</ref> <bdbheb>כי כל משׁפטיו לנגדי</bdbheb> (|| <bdbheb>לֹא אָסִיר מֶנִּי</bdbheb>), with <highlight>to set</highlight> or <highlight>place</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ps 16:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,16,8)\">Ps 16:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 54:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"54\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"54\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,54,5)\">Ps 54:5</ref> <bdbheb>לא שׂמו אלהים לנגדם</bdbheb> (compare <ref ref=\"Ps 86:14\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"86\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"86\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(19,86,14)\">Ps 86:14</ref>,), <ref ref=\"Ps 90:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"90\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"90\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,90,8)\">Ps 90:8</ref> often in the phrase <bdbheb>לְנֶגֶד עֵינֵי ֗֗֗ </bdbheb>, both literal, as <ref ref=\"Job 4:16\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(18,4,16)\">Job 4:16</ref> <bdbheb>תְּמוּנָה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>עֵינָ֑י</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לנ</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Ps 5:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,5,6)\">Ps 5:6</ref> <bdbheb>עיניך</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לא יתיצבו הוללים לנ</bdbheb> (compare <ref ref=\"Ps 101:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"101\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"101\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,101,7)\">Ps 101:7</ref>); and in a moral sense, <ref ref=\"Ps 18:25\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(19,18,25)\">Ps 18:25</ref> <bdbheb>עיניו</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כְּבֹר ידי לנ</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Ps 26:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,26,3)\">Ps 26:3</ref> <bdbheb>עיני</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כי חסדך לנ</bdbheb> i.e. is ever present to my mind, <ref ref=\"Ps 36:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,36,2)\">Ps 36:2</ref> <bdbheb>עיניו</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אין פחד אלהים לנ</bdbheb> i.e. he has no eye to discern God's awe-inspiring judgments (compare <ref ref=\"Ps 10:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,10,5)\">Ps 10:5</ref>); with <bdbheb>לא אשׁית</bdbheb> i.e. have in view, purpose (|| <bdbheb>שׂנאתי</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Ps 101:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"101\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"101\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,101,3)\">Ps 101:3</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <bdbheb>מִנֶּגֶד</bdbheb> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;\\&emsp;(<highlight>a</highlight>) <b>adverb</b> <highlight>off</highlight> (<bdbheb>מִן</bdbheb> <b>1 c</b>) <highlight>the front, in front, opposite, ex adverso</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Gen 21:16\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(1,21,16)\">Gen 21:16</ref> <bdbheb>ותשׁב להּ מנגד</bdbheb> sat her down <highlight>opposite</highlight>, v<ref ref=\"Gen 21:16\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(1,21,16)\">Gen 21:16</ref>, <ref ref=\"2Kgs 2:7\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(12,2,7)\">2Kgs 2:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 28:66\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"66\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"66\" onclick=\"bcv(5,28,66)\">Deut 28:66</ref> <bdbheb>והיו חייך תלואים לך מנגד</bdbheb> shall be hung up for thee <highlight>in front</highlight> (i.e. suspended, as by a thread, in front of thee); <ref ref=\"Judg 9:17\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(7,9,17)\">Judg 9:17</ref> <bdbheb>וישׁלך נפשׁו מנגד</bdbheb> and flung away his life <highlight>in front</highlight> or <highlight>straight away</highlight> (i.e. hazarded it); = <highlight>some way off, from</highlight> or <highlight>at a distance</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Num 2:2\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(4,2,2)\">Num 2:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 32:52\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"52\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"52\" onclick=\"bcv(5,32,52)\">Deut 32:52</ref> <bdbheb>כי מִנֶּגֶד</bdbheb> <bdbheb>תראה את הארץ</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"2Kgs 2:15\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(12,2,15)\">2Kgs 2:15</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וַיִּרְאֻהוּ מנ</bdbheb> <highlight>at a distance</highlight>, <ref ref=\"2Kgs 3:22\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(12,3,22)\">2Kgs 3:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 4:25\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(12,4,25)\">2Kgs 4:25</ref> <highlight>aloof</highlight>, <ref ref=\"2Sam 18:13\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(10,18,13)\">2Sam 18:13</ref> <bdbheb>ואתה תתיצב מנגד</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Obad 1:11\" b=\"31\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(31,1,11)\">Obad 1:11</ref> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;\\&emsp;(<highlight>b</highlight>) as a <b>preposition</b> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;\\&emsp;(<highlight>a</highlight>) <highlight>from the front of, away from</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Song 6:5\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(22,6,5)\">Song 6:5</ref> <bdbheb>הָסֵבִּי עֵינַיִךְ מִנֶּגְדִּי</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"1Sam 26:20\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(9,26,20)\">1Sam 26:20</ref> <bdbheb>אליֿפֹל</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>פני י</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>דמי ארצה מנ</bdbheb>; <bdbheb>מנגד עיני</bdbheb> <highlight>from before the eyes of</highlight>, with verbs of removing <ref ref=\"Isa 1:16\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(23,1,16)\">Isa 1:16</ref>, cutting off <ref ref=\"Ps 31:23\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(19,31,23)\">Ps 31:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jonah 2:5\" b=\"32\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(32,2,5)\">Jonah 2:5</ref>, hiding <ref ref=\"Amos 9:3\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(30,9,3)\">Amos 9:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 16:17\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(24,16,17)\">Jer 16:17</ref>. (<grk>β</grk>) <highlight>opposite to</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Neh 3:19\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(16,3,19)\">Neh 3:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 3:25\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(16,3,25)\">Neh 3:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 3:27\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(16,3,27)\">Neh 3:27</ref> <highlight>at a distance from</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Ps 10:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,10,5)\">Ps 10:5</ref> <bdbheb>מרום משׁפטיך מנגדו</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Ps 38:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,38,12)\">Ps 38:12</ref> <bdbheb>מנגד נגעי יעמדו</bdbheb>. (<grk>γ</grk>) <bdbheb>מִנֶּגֶד לְ</bdbheb> <highlight>from before</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Prov 14:7\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(20,14,7)\">Prov 14:7</ref>, <highlight>in front of</highlight> <ref ref=\"Judg 20:34\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(7,20,34)\">Judg 20:34</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> <bdbheb>עַד נֶגֶד</bdbheb> <highligh